# n8n's root .gitignore excludes **/package-lock.json because that monorepo
# is pnpm-only. This app is a standalone npm project outside that workspace, so
# its lockfile has to be tracked -- otherwise Vercel resolves different versions
# than the ones verified here. Harmless when this folder is its own repository.
!package-lock.json
